/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 44 0 R
/E (To design and build functional reports, dashboards, and a custom page in Zoho Creator that consolidate and visualise the booking data captured by the Hotel_Booking_Form, enabling the front office and sales team to monitor booking-pipeline progress, room-type demand, and check-in timing at a glance.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [9]
>>
